slides.prompt:
A high-impact title slide that pulses with digital energy. A deep navy canvas is brought to life by large, flowing organic shapes in vibrant sky blue and deep pink gradients. The typography is centered and modern, anchored by a sophisticated 'Nexus' logo that glows with a subtle neon effect. This design immediately establishes a premium, tech-forward agency feel. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "CenteredHero",
    "alignment": "center"
  },
  "colors": {
    "bg": "#0F1528",
    "primary_gradient": ["#0EA5E9", "#D946EF"],
    "text": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "organic_shapes": { "type": "fluid-blobs", "opacity": "0.6", "blur": "40px" },
    "logo": { "icon": "activity", "glow": "#0EA5E9" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "h1": { "size": "80px", "weight": "900", "tracking": "-0.02em" },
    "subline": { "size": "18px", "color": "#94A3B8", "tracking": "0.5em" }
  }
}

A sophisticated data overview slide that visualizes performance with absolute clarity and elegance. Three large circular progress indicators dominate the layout, each featuring a vibrant gradient border that transitions through blue, purple, and pink. Bold tabular typography inside each ring communicates high-stakes metrics at a glance. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ThreeRingGrid",
  "rings": [
    { "value": "75%", "label": "RELIABILITY", "color": "#0EA5E9" },
    { "value": "50%", "label": "GROWTH", "color": "#A855F7" },
    { "value": "98%", "label": "INNOVATION", "color": "#D946EF" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "value": "Black 48px #FFFFFF",
    "label": "Bold 12px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A strategy-focused slide that emphasizes the company's core values through modular design. Three circular icon containers, glowing in deep pink gradients, act as visual anchors for the three strategic pillars. The layout is clean and balanced, ensuring the viewer can easily navigate the underlying philosophy of growth. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ModularPillars",
  "components": [
    { "title": "IDEATION", "icon": "lightbulb", "gradient": "pink" },
    { "title": "EFFICIENCY", "icon": "zap", "gradient": "purple" },
    { "title": "VALUE", "icon": "target", "gradient": "blue" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "p_title": "Bold 22px #FFFFFF",
    "p_desc": "Regular 14px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A high-density analytics slide designed to communicate market supremacy. A large, multi-layered bar chart utilizes the master gradient palette to show quarter-over-quarter growth. The layout is technical and sharp, featuring clean gridlines and precise labels that withstand executive scrutiny. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DashboardChart",
  "chart": {
    "type": "Bar",
    "layers": 3,
    "gradient": ["#D946EF", "#A855F7"],
    "grid_color": "rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"
  },
  "typography": {
    "axis_labels": "Medium 10px #64748B",
    "legend": "Bold 12px #FFFFFF"
  }
}

A striking timeline slide that visualizes the company's journey through a centered donut chart. The chart is segmented into key years, with each segment connected by elegant lines to detailed text blocks. This layout communicates a sense of cumulative success and cyclical growth. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TimelineDonut",
  "chart": {
    "segments": 3,
    "inner_radius": "70%",
    "labels": ["2020", "2021", "2022"]
  },
  "typography": {
    "year_font": "Black 18px #FFFFFF",
    "desc_font": "Regular 12px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A powerful and human-centric closing slide that emphasizes core philosophy. A massive, centered quote block is framed by vibrant organic wave shapes in the corners, mirroring the energy of the title slide. The typography is bold and italicized, making the mission statement look like a work of digital art. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ArtisticQuote",
  "visuals": {
    "waves": { "color": ["#0EA5E9", "#D946EF"], "pos": "corners" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "quote": { "size": "32px", "weight": "900", "color": "#FFFFFF", "italic": true, "max_width": "800px" },
    "attribution": { "size": "14px", "color": "#0EA5E9", "weight": "Bold" }
  }
}
